WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:05,190
I don’t want to be hungry now

2
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:08,390
I went down to eat with the man named Shen.

3
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:09,990
Are you still shameless?

4
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:11,790
If you no longer need them, drive them away.

5
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:17,720
If you want to leave, go and drag me along. Why is my surname Bai?

6
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,560
Don’t fail to recognize good people’s hearts

7
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,840
I dragged you away for your own good

8
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:25,510
You said that in front of Shen Xiujing

9
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:27,230
Don’t you mean Shen Xiujing?

10
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:28,230
Interested in Jian Tong

11
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:30,540
Are you mentally ill?

12
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:33,380
Shen Xiujing Jian Tong

13
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:35,970
Xia Weiming's life is there

14
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,460
The eldest lady of the Jian family three years ago

15
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:40,980
That's all on the beach in Shanghai

16
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:42,260
A lonely red rose

17
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:44,340
How many young masters have made achievements before and after?

18
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:45,860
Just to have a chat with him

19
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,100
Look at the person lying on the bed now

20
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:49,540
Is he really Jian Tong?

21
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:52,550
Weren't you surprised when you first saw it?

22
00:00:56,290 --> 00:00:57,690
Made people look like this

23
00:00:58,980 --> 00:01:00,820
Shen Xiujing will be interested in him

24
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,220
You know shit

25
00:01:03,850 --> 00:01:04,810
Can't speak well

26
00:01:05,130 --> 00:01:08,050
Saying you know nothing is just flattering you.

27
00:01:08,410 --> 00:01:09,370
I treat you to a supper
